{"seq":1,"slug":"property-based-testing","title":"基于属性的测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-testing-qa/advanced-techniques/property-based-testing","wordCount":1428,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"基于属性的测试\">基于属性的测试</h1><p>为一个列表排序函数写测试，你大概会写：输入 <code>[3, 1, 2]</code>，期望输出 <code>[1, 2, 3]</code>。再加几个手挑的例子。但你怎么知道这几个例子覆盖了重复元素、空列表、已排序输入、逆序输入、超长列表、负数与极值的混合？<a href=\"../foundations/test-design-techniques\">测试用例设计技术</a> 教的等价类与边界值，本质上还是「人去想代表性例子」，而人的想象力恰恰是最不可靠的环节。基于属性的测试（Property-Based Testing，PBT）换了个根本思路：你不再写具体例子，而是描述「对任意合法输入都应成立的规律」，剩下的成千上万个例子交给框架去生成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>PBT 的工作流是一个生成—检验—收缩的循环。你声明一条<strong>属性</strong>（property）——一个对随机输入的断言；框架用<strong>生成器</strong>（generator）产出大量随机输入去试图证伪它；一旦找到反例，框架启动<strong>收缩</strong>（shrinking），把那个可能很复杂的反例自动简化成最小的等价复现案例。主流实现包括 Python 的 Hypothesis、TypeScript 的 fast-check、JVM 的 jqwik（参见 2026 年对生成式测试的趋势综述）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[声明属性: 对任意输入P成立] --&gt; B[生成器产出随机输入]&#10;    B --&gt; C{P 成立?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是, 默认跑100次| D[通过]&#10;    C --&gt;|否, 找到反例| E[收缩: 简化反例]&#10;    E --&gt; F[报告最小复现案例]\">graph TD\n    A[声明属性: 对任意输入P成立] --&gt; B[生成器产出随机输入]\n    B --&gt; C{P 成立?}\n    C --&gt;|是, 默认跑100次| D[通过]\n    C --&gt;|否, 找到反例| E[收缩: 简化反例]\n    E --&gt; F[报告最小复现案例]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>举例式测试</th>\n<th>基于属性的测试</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>你写的内容</td>\n<td>具体输入与期望输出</td>\n<td>对任意输入的不变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入来源</td>\n<td>人手工挑选</td>\n<td>框架随机生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖的情况</td>\n<td>有限、受想象力限制</td>\n<td>大量、含意外边界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败时</td>\n<td>直接给出失败例</td>\n<td>自动收缩成最小反例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要风险</td>\n<td>漏掉没想到的情况</td>\n<td>属性写错或写弱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"如何提炼属性\">如何提炼属性</h2><p>PBT 最难的不是用框架，而是「想出好的属性」。因为正确答案往往和被测函数一样难写——如果你能轻松算出排序的期望结果，那干嘛还要排序函数？业界总结出几类可复用的属性模式，帮你绕开这个困境。</p>\n<p><strong>往返属性</strong>（round-trip）：编码后再解码应回到原值，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>decode</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>encode</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{decode}(\\text{encode}(x)) = x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">decode</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">encode</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>。序列化、压缩、加解密都天然满足，验证起来无需独立算出期望值。<strong>不变量属性</strong>（invariant）：某些性质在操作前后恒定，比如排序后列表长度不变、元素集合不变、相邻元素满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i \\le a_{i+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<strong>等价属性</strong>（oracle）：一个简单但慢的参考实现与你的优化实现应给出相同结果，比如用朴素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 算法当「神谕」校验你的快速算法。<strong>幂等属性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(f(x)) = f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，如去重、规范化、绝对值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from hypothesis import given, strategies as st&#10;&#10;@given(st.lists(st.integers()))&#10;def test_sort_properties(xs):&#10;    result = sorted(xs)&#10;    assert len(result) == len(xs)              # 不变量：长度不变&#10;    assert sorted(result) == result            # 幂等：排好的再排不变&#10;    for a, b in zip(result, result[1:]):&#10;        assert a &lt;= b                          # 有序性\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hypothesis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> given, strategies </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> st</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(st.lists(st.integers()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_sort_properties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(xs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(xs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(xs)              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 不变量：长度不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 幂等：排好的再排不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a, b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result, result[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:]):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b                          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 有序性</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"收缩-pbt-的杀手锏\">收缩：PBT 的杀手锏</h2><p>随机生成的反例往往又长又乱——框架可能告诉你「<code>[847, -23, 0, 847, 156, -23, ...]</code> 让你的函数崩了」，但这一大坨里到底哪个元素是关键？收缩就是为解决这个痛点而生：找到反例后，框架不停地尝试「更小、更简单」的变体（删元素、缩数值、向 0 靠拢），只要变体仍然失败就保留，直到无法再简化。</p>\n<p>于是那个 20 个元素的反例可能被收缩成 <code>[0, 0]</code> 或 <code>[1]</code>——一个一眼就能看懂根因的最小案例。这把调试从「在噪声里大海捞针」变成「面对一个干净的最小复现」。收缩的价值怎么强调都不过分：它是 PBT 相比「自己写个随机测试循环」的决定性优势，后者即使撞到 bug，也只会甩给你一堆无法理解的随机数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[随机反例: 20个杂乱元素] --&gt; B[尝试删除一半元素]&#10;    B --&gt; C{仍失败?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| B&#10;    C --&gt;|否, 回退| D[尝试缩小单个数值]&#10;    D --&gt; E{仍失败?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| D&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[最小反例: 例如 0,0]\">flowchart TD\n    A[随机反例: 20个杂乱元素] --&gt; B[尝试删除一半元素]\n    B --&gt; C{仍失败?}\n    C --&gt;|是| B\n    C --&gt;|否, 回退| D[尝试缩小单个数值]\n    D --&gt; E{仍失败?}\n    E --&gt;|是| D\n    E --&gt;|否| F[最小反例: 例如 0,0]</pre><h2 id=\"pbt-在测试金字塔中的位置\">PBT 在测试金字塔中的位置</h2><p>PBT 不是一个新的「测试层级」，而是一种可以叠加在任何层级上的<strong>输入生成策略</strong>。它最常用于单元层——为纯函数、解析器、序列化器、数据结构、状态机这类「逻辑密集、输入空间大」的代码补强。它与 <a href=\"../test-levels/unit-testing\">单元测试与测试替身</a> 并不冲突：保留少量手写的关键示例（它们最能表达意图、定位回归），再用属性去扫荡你想不到的边界，两者互补。</p>\n<p>PBT 也直接呼应了 <a href=\"../foundations/testing-principles\">测试原则与测试金字塔</a> 里的「杀虫剂悖论」——固定的举例式测试跑久了会失效，而每次运行都生成新随机输入的 PBT 天然抵抗这种钝化。它和后两篇技术的分工也很清晰：PBT 关注<strong>逻辑属性是否成立</strong>（需要你写出断言）；<a href=\"fuzzing\">模糊测试</a> 关注<strong>程序会不会崩</strong>（断言是「不崩溃」这一隐式属性），用覆盖率反馈引导输入；而 <a href=\"mutation-testing\">变异测试</a> 则反过来评估「你写的这些属性和测试到底够不够狠」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>你提供什么</th>\n<th>框架找什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基于属性的测试</td>\n<td>显式的逻辑不变量</td>\n<td>违反不变量的最小输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模糊测试</td>\n<td>几乎不需要（隐式属性=不崩溃）</td>\n<td>触发崩溃/越界的输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变异测试</td>\n<td>已有的测试套件</td>\n<td>测试杀不死的代码变异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PBT 把测试从「人写具体例子」提升到「人写不变量、机器生成例子」，绕开人类想象力的盲区。</li>\n<li>工作流是生成—检验—收缩；主流工具有 Hypothesis、fast-check、jqwik。</li>\n<li>提炼属性是核心难点，可复用模式包括往返（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>decode</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>encode</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{decode}(\\text{encode}(x))=x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">decode</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">encode</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>）、不变量、等价神谕、幂等（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(f(x))=f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>收缩自动把杂乱反例简化成最小复现案例，是 PBT 相对手写随机测试的决定性优势。</li>\n<li>PBT 是叠加在 <a href=\"../test-levels/unit-testing\">单元测试</a> 等层级上的输入策略，与手写关键示例互补，并天然抵抗杀虫剂悖论。</li>\n<li>三种进阶技术分工：PBT 验逻辑属性、<a href=\"fuzzing\">模糊测试</a> 找崩溃、<a href=\"mutation-testing\">变异测试</a> 评测试有效性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基于属性的测试","id":"基于属性的测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"如何提炼属性","id":"如何提炼属性"},{"level":2,"text":"收缩：PBT 的杀手锏","id":"收缩-pbt-的杀手锏"},{"level":2,"text":"PBT 在测试金字塔中的位置","id":"pbt-在测试金字塔中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"端到端与系统测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-testing-qa/test-levels/e2e-testing"},"next":{"title":"模糊测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-testing-qa/advanced-techniques/fuzzing"}}